1
00:00:00,703 --> 00:00:02,163
(Sheldon:)- Show me...
- Sheldon?

2
00:00:02,330 --> 00:00:04,330
[SPEAKING IN MANDARIN]

3
00:00:05,208 --> 00:00:06,248
(Leonard:)I'm sorry.

4
00:00:07,502 --> 00:00:09,002
Look, do you have a second?

5
00:00:09,170 --> 00:00:11,920
(Sheldon:)A second what? Pair of underwear?

6
00:00:12,090 --> 00:00:14,300
(Penny:)I was just wondering
if I could talk to you.

7
00:00:14,467 --> 00:00:15,507
(Penny:)It's about Leonard.

8
00:00:16,010 --> 00:00:18,850
(Sheldon:)Why me?
Why not Koothrappali or Wolowitz?

9
00:00:19,013 --> 00:00:21,513
(Penny:)Well, Raj can't talk to me
unless he's drunk.

10
00:00:21,683 --> 00:00:25,143
(Penny:)And Wolowitz is, you know, disgusting.

11
00:00:25,937 --> 00:00:28,317
SHELDON:
Yes, I suppose he is.

12
00:00:29,440 --> 00:00:32,030
(Penny:)All I'm saying
is you know Leonard the best.

13
00:00:32,193 --> 00:00:36,443
(Sheldon:)Not necessarily. I'm often surprised
by my lack of familiarity with Leonard.

14
00:00:36,614 --> 00:00:41,614
(Sheldon:)Just the other day, I discovered
he not only has a loofah, he hides it.

15
00:00:41,786 --> 00:00:44,576
(Sheldon:)Why do you suppose a man
would be ashamed of having a loofah?

16
00:00:44,747 --> 00:00:48,167
(Sheldon:)I myself prefer to have my excess
epithelial cells slough off naturally...

17
00:00:48,334 --> 00:00:51,624
(Sheldon:)...but I don't condemn those
who seek to accelerate the process.

18
00:00:52,463 --> 00:00:56,463
(Sheldon:)And until recently, I had no idea
that despite his lactose intolerance...

19
00:00:56,634 --> 00:00:59,134
(Sheldon:)...he can tolerate small amounts
of nonfat ice cream...

20
00:00:59,303 --> 00:01:01,223
(Sheldon:)...without producing a noxious gas...

